Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 在古老的中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long ago, in ancient China,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,孔雀王统治着宫门城\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Peacocks ruled over Gongmen City.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为城里的百姓带来了欢乐和繁荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought great joy and prosperity to the city…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们发明烟火\N{\fnArial\fs30}for they had invented fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们的儿子 沈王爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But their son, Lord Shen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了烟火的邪恶力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw darker power in the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来缤纷欢乐的烟火\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had brought colour and joy…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以制造黑暗和毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}could also bring darkness and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的双亲居心的向羊仙姑求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen's troubled parents consulted a soothsayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:01:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙姑预言，沈王爷如果继续这条黑暗之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}She foretold that if Shen continued down this dark path,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后终将被一名黑白大侠所击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would be defeated by a warrior of black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的沈王爷决心要改变命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}The young lord set out to change his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到这样反而走上了不归路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what he did next only sealed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他满怀信心回去见双亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen returned to his parents full of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而，他们的脸上只有恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in their faces, he saw only horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被永远逐出城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was banished from the city forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他发誓报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Shen swore revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天他会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday he would return…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让全中国臣服在他的脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of China would bow at his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快完成了 沈王爷 但材料用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost done, Lord Shen, but we've run out of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到各个村庄去搜刮，去找金银铜铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search the farthest villages! Find more metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国会是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}China will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:36.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,《功夫熊猫2》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说，神龙大侠就加入了盖世五侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the Dragon Warrior joined the Furious Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们加在一起武功盖世，绚到不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they became the most awesomest kung fu team ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,费话少说，开打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough talk. Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三十一个… - 快听 你听到没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirty-three… - Listen, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙大侠正在里面练功！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hear the Dragon Warrior training right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十三个 行了 别继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-three. Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三十四个。- 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirty-four. - It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三十五个。你要专心 - 三十六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirty-five. Stay focused. - Thirty-six!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:02:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底是怎么塞进去的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he doing that with his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十八个豆沙包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-eight bean buns!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好哦，新纪录了 你真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! New record! You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续塞 四十个 - 四十个不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep going! Hit 40! - He'll never hit 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 伙计 我要挑战四十！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys wait and we'll go to 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了 - 阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did it! - Well done, Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是苦练有成啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your training has paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 师父在叫 先闪了 回头见了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu! Gotta go. See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会留几个给我吧，啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll save those for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心 静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父你好 这次是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu, what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有海贼？火山帮那群土匪？（古日耳曼人的一支）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates? VandaIs of Volcano Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁来乱我都能搞定 我斗志高昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, I will take them down. 'Cause I am in a mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拳头和我一样 你了我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get something done, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，这是哪一招啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是龟大仙传授给我的最后绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Master Oogway's final teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,超赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 平心静气 - 平心静气 这很酷哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inner peace. - Inner piece. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鼻子要干嘛？- 你接下来会练这个功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inner piece of what? - It is the next phase of your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,功夫高手都有独门修练法以达到平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every master must find his path to inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人会在洞穴五十年里打坐禅修就像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some choose to meditate for 50 years in a cave just like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,完完全全不吃不喝也不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the slightest taste of food or water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人则是一再苦修 像我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some find it through pain and suffering, as I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 你被选为神龙大侠的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, the day you were chosen as Dragon Warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我这辈子最惨淡的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the worst day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今都没那么惨过\N{\fnArial\fs30}By far. Nothing else came close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最痛苦 最难过 失望的一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the worst, most painful, mind-destroying, horrible moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 最可怕的一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - I have ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当我发现问题不在于你，而在于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once I realised the problem was not you, but within me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就平心静气了 因此才能吸取天地万物的精华\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found inner peace and was able to harness the flow of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.94,0:06:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这这样子哦 我只平心静气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it? I just need inner peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的Body早就超超超平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}My innards are already super, super peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在只要让心平静下来就搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so all I need to do is just get this thing going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气 你没戏唱啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace, you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,秀一下你刚练脚的那招吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now show me what you were doing there with your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脚下功夫挺花巧哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you do sort of a fancy foot…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波！有土匪 即将杀进乐师村\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! Bandits! Approaching the Musicians Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,找那些乐师们演奏动作片的音乐 因为我要开打了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell those musicians to start playing some action music because it is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,安啦 师父 打完一轮我肯定平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Shifu, I'll master inner peace as soon as I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准在路上买点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No snack stops this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！不要闹了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snack stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎，真的不准哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把金银铜铁全带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get all the metal you can find!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, help, help, help. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到手了 我们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's everything! Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,展翅正义扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wings of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 是神龙大侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只熊猫？这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A panda? That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的拳头渴望伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fist hungers for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是拳头的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my…fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他 - 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get 'em! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.31,0:08:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 有飞箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! lncoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 快螳螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎 同璧连环踢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress, Double Death Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没影脚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feet of Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎！猴王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress! Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,俏小龙！快螳螂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viper! Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,兔宝宝！什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunny! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 I'S\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 灵鹤 救 - 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crane, go! - I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死活该 死胖子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chew on that, tubby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetie, are you OK? - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚好像看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 欢迎光临咱们神龙大侠面条豆腐店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you for coming to Dragon Warrior Noodles and Tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来点茶？还是柠檬汁？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More tea? Lemon sauce? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要点些什么 就喊一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need anything, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 愤怒的脚步！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Feet of Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙大侠的拖把 他用来拖过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dragon Warrior's mop. He mopped these very floors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别要乱碰 你会弄脏拖把\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touching! You'll get the mop dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他端过面给我吃耶 - 超赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He once waited on me. - Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还留下了个印子 嘿 神龙大侠在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I have the stain to prove it. Hey, where is the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这里干活了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't work here any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在外面忙着 保护和平谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busy out there protecting the Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神龙大侠 - 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Dragon Warrior! - There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来亲亲 好 - 神龙大侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. OK. Nice kid. - The Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要回来也不先说一声。- 嗨 爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should've told me you were coming. - Hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好给你留两盘臭豆腐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have saved you some stinky tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爹 谈一下好吗？- 当然好 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, can I talk to you? - Of course, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 庆祝我儿子回家 今天的豆包我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}In honour of my son, free tofu dessert for everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要点餐才送哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}With purchases.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真是太好了 阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's so good to see you, Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是变小只了？我快要可以用翅膀圈住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost weight? I can almost put my wings around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃呃 瘦了一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 你想你一定饿昏了吧 我给你弄碗热汤喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor you, you must feel weak. Let me get you some soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不 不用了 爹 我现在不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's OK, Dad. I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽然不饿？阿波你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry? Po, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没事 我很好 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I'm fine. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来之前才和土匪打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlier today, I was fighting these bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 很危险啦…就是那拉啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing too dangerous. I mean, they were just, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 突然发生一件了超怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - And then the strangest thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一个幻像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this crazy vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像看我娘跟我小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw my mom and me, as a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你娘？小时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? A baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爹？- 天呐！你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - What…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是从哪来的啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did I come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 儿子 鹅宝宝都是来自小鹅蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you see, son, baby geese come from a little egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不准你问我蛋从哪儿来哦 - 爹 我不是问那个啦.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't ask where the egg comes from. - Dad, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我知道你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在也该是时候了，其实我要跟你说的早就该跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time I told you something I should have told you a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 也可以算是我 我 我领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have been kind of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 - 你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁说的？- 摆脱 少来啦 爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, who told you? - No one. I mean, come on, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知道 那你从来为什么不说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you knew, why didn't you ever say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么从来不说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么来这儿的？爹 我从哪儿来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get here, Dad? Where did I come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 …你从这里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…you came from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天跟平常没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just another day at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正打算做面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to make the noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就先到后面去 我叫的菜全都已经送到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went out to the back, where my vegetables had just been delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫了高丽菜 大头菜 萝卜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were cabbages, turnips, radishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我没看到萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only there were no radishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只看到一只饿扁的熊猫宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a very hungry baby panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,篮子里没有纸条\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no note.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 可能是被你吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you could have eaten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看有没有人来找你，但是没人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I waited for someone to come looking for you, but no one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便带你到里面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave you a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再喂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fed you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想帮你穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tried to put some pants on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我做出了一个改变我一生的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I made a decision that would change my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:15:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定不再用萝卜熬汤头\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make my soup without radishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 把你当成亲生儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to raise you as my own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小阿波 我的小熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Xiao Po, my little panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那刻开始 我的面汤和人生都变得更加鲜美\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from that moment on, both my soup and my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,都变得更加鲜美\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been that much sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小波 故事就到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, little Po, that's the end of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我 不要看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. No, don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样子？不可能啊 一定还有别的 爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it? That can't be it. There's gotta be more, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 就是你把我的竹椅竹桌全部都啃光光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was the time you ate all my bamboo furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 全都是进口货\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was imported, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 我要一个包子 神龙大侠包\N{\fnArial\fs30}One dumpling, please, Dragon Warrior size.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 你的故事也许没有快乐的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Po, your story may not have such a happy beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结局很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but look how it turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我 你功夫高强 你有吃不完的面条哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me, you got kung fu, and you got noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是有好多疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I just have so many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我怎么可能塞得进这个小篮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like how did I ever fit in this tiny basket?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不爱穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I like pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who am l?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Watch your form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好了 肘击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better. Elbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,沈王爷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,三们大侠 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:17:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,客套话就不用多说了，请离开我的王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we've got the pleasantries out of the way, please leave my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的王宫？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your house? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没看到门口的孔雀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see the peacock on the front door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 你在这啊 羊仙姑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Soothsayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你这个半仙之前的预言不怎么灵光嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems your fortune-telling skilIs are not as good as you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等着瞧 王爷 - 是你等着瞧老山羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We shall see, Shen. - No, you shall see, old goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们讲到哪了？- 你想要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were we? - What do you want, Shen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿回属于我的一切 宫门城\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is rightfully mine. Gongmen City!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,宫门城隶属于长老会管辖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gongmen is under the stewardship of the Masters' Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我们负责保护 所以你别想染指\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will protect it. Even from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你这么说我好安慰啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我把它拖来就白费功夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I'd have dragged that here for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子里装的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the box, Shen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看吗？那是礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see? It's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给你们的礼物，它会让你们身首异处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your parting gift, in that it will part you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块掉这 半截在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of you here, part of you there…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有有一团飞到那，弄到墙上好脏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and part of you way over there, staining the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这大胆狂徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You insolent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还行 - 这只是个警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show-off. - That is a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的功夫根本打不过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no match for our kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知不知道掌管宫门城大侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you familiar with the master of Gongmen City?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷霆犀利侠哦？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master Thundering Rhino? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞天铁犀侠大英雄的儿子？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of legendary Flying Rhino? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经在万邪谷亲手杀死过邪恶万蛇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And slayer of the Ten Thousand Serpents in the Valley of Woe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dead. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,犀利侠的护身牛角可化解任何招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhino's Horn Defence is impervious to any technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是败给武功 沈王爷打造了一种武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was no technique. Lord Shen has created a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能喷出烈火射出炮弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}one that breathes fire and spits metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不去阻止他 很可能就再也没有功夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he is stopped, this could be the end of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是我才刚上手啊！- 所以你要拯救它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I just got kung fu! - And now you must save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去！快去摧毁那个武器 将沈王爷绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Destroy this weapon and bring Lord Shen to justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, here we go! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 等一下下 那我要怎么做呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. How can I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,功夫要怎么样打败能打败功夫的东东\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how can kung fu stop something that stops kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住神龙大侠 只要能平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Dragon Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事都可能做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything is possible when you have inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace. Inner peace. Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气 拼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Po?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Po, I got you a travel pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你收拾好了 够吃好几个礼拜 饼干包子几样小菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I packed you food for weeks. Cookies, buns, vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的五侠公仔全放进去了 你看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I even packed all your action figures. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！哈哈哈 哦哎哟 我不知道那是什么 我这辈子从没看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what those are. Never seen them before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹 你把我的捍娇虎刮花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you got scratches on my Tigress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也放了咱们爷俩快乐时光的画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also packed your paintings of our best time together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免你觉得寂寞 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case you get lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们一起做面条。这是我们一起吃面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me and you making noodles. And that's me and you eating noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我背着你玩骑马打仗 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's me giving you a piggyback ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是把这张留下来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cute? On second thought, I'll hang on to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 他们都在等我 - 知道 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, they're waiting for me. - Of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身负重任 远离家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a job to do…far from home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,陌生城市 人生地不熟的 面条的味道也怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a strange city, filled with strange people, and strange noodles,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对可怕的危险 可能会有去无回！\N{\fnArial\fs30}facing horrible danger from which you might never return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别走 阿波！- 我一定得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go, Po! - I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是神龙大侠 我的使命就是要拯救功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Dragon Warrior. It's kind of my job to save kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不去的话 那我会是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't…what am l?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子啊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 该走了 - 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po, it's time. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:20:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹅阿爹 您放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Mr. Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「面条」两个字还没说完 他就会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back before you can say "noodles".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙快点 出发咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹？娘？是你们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹！娘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦嗨 嘿 嘿 儿子 回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi. Hey, son. You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 你怎么在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.58,0:23:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.79,0:23:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把你换掉了 换来这个可爱的萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We replaced you, dear, with this lovely radish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萝卜？- 他安静 有礼貌 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Radish? - It's quiet, polite, and, frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,功夫也比你厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}does better kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.39,0:23:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.24,0:23:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝卜 萝卜 萝卜…搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radish, radish, radish, radish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner pea…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.09,0:23:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,平…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pea…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.57,0:24:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace! Inner peace! Inner peace! Inner peace! Inner peace..!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.33,0:24:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 呃 我在练功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…training.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,桅杆不算可敬的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mast is not a worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.51,0:24:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我准备好了 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am ready. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好严肃哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.73,0:24:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我还是打船杆好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I prefer the mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我不好 我以前都是利用皇宫旁的铁木桩来练功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies. I used to punch the ironwood trees by the palace to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.87,0:24:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I feel nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是酷到破表\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's severely cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.17,0:25:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你用铁木桩练功 总共练了多少年\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this punching ironwood trees, how long did you have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二十年了 - 哦 二十 二十年啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twenty years. - Oh, 20, 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.97,0:25:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有快一点的方法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any, you know, faster way?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.39,0:25:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以马上让我变到没有感觉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, until you, you know, don't feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.27,0:25:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.23,0:25:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得硬功不是你的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think hard style is your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 你到底出来做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, why are you really out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚发现我爹他不是我亲生的爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found out that my dad isn't really my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爹？就那只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad? The goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你一定吓了一大跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must have been quite a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.01,0:25:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.55,0:25:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你心情不好？- 你在开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And this bothers you? - Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.10,0:25:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是大侠哎 拥有钢铁意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're warriors, right? Nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.27,0:25:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,白金般毅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}SouIs of platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是强者完全没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hard-core, you don't feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.24,0:26:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是… - 你们两在哈聊什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was… - So, what are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啦 没啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波跟他爹有心结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po's having daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.41,0:26:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我幸运真好 我跟我爹完全没心结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so lucky. I don't have any problems with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.71,0:26:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没出生，我爹的头就被娘咬掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's because Mom ate his head before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.25,0:26:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 快螳螂 又不是在说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Mantis, this isn't about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.26,0:26:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波他现在心情很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po is the one freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.47,0:26:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有很糟 - 阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not freaking out. - Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在很嗨 - 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm freaking in. - Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.02,0:26:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,宫门城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gongmen City.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父王的宝座\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前常让我在旁边玩耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to let me play here beside him,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.25,0:27:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证 将来王位会是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}promising someday, this throne would be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.60,0:27:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左边挪一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可是这很重哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but it's so heavy, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.35,0:27:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等了三十年 就等这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years I've waited for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一样东西都要完全符合我的想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything must be exactly how I envisioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.48,0:27:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像这个再左边一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I envisioned it a little to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.11,0:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件武器就在我的…再往过去一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the weapon by my si…A little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.95,0:27:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件武器在我身边全中国都会臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the weapon by my side, all of China will bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三天后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move out in three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.71,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那月圆之日 潮涨之刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the moon is full and the tide is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.22,0:27:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老山羊 不如你替我算一算我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you old goat, why don't you tell me my…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.51,0:27:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来 我要说的是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future. I was going to say future.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.40,0:27:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下你的碗 说说我未来的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into your bowl and tell me what glory awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.69,0:28:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若是再一意孤行下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you continue on your current path…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.58,0:28:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会发现自己最后在楼梯底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will find yourseIf at the bottom of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.21,0:28:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.63,0:28:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见痛苦 还有愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see pain…and anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.26,0:28:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的胆子！这是全省最好的丝绸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you! That is the finest silk in the province!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还会耍赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followed by denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.64,0:28:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本不叫算命 你只是说出现在发生的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not fortune-telling. You're just saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.43,0:28:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事？- 现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's happening right… - Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的时刻就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most important time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的想预见未来的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you really want to see the future…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.32,0:28:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只孔雀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A peacock…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一名黑白大侠打的落花流水\N{\fnArial\fs30}is defeated by a warrior of black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.34,0:28:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.89,0:29:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的事 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.60,0:29:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是不可能的事 他也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not impossible, and he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.98,0:29:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沈王爷 有一只熊猫 - 熊猫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Shen! I saw a panda! - A panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.70,0:29:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个功夫高手 张牙舞爪像恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kung fu warrior. It fought like a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大只毛又多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big and furry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,柔棉棉好好摸 肥都都的好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soft and squishy. Kind of plush and cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.71,0:29:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上熊猫已经绝种了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no more pandas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.09,0:29:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼睛虽然不好都还能看清事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with his poor eyesight, he can see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.59,0:29:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你就是看不清呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it that you cannot?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.39,0:29:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到这只熊猫 然后带他来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find this panda and bring him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.68,0:29:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.60,0:29:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这这么一只熊猫也不能证明你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One panda lives. That does not make you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对 你迟早会知道我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Being right makes me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就杀了他 证明你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will kill him and make you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.99,0:29:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你不要再啃了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是沈王爷的宫殿就在城的另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be Shen's palace on the other side of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.43,0:30:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 让我们冲进高塔大喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We'll march into the tower and proclaim,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.14,0:30:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是神龙大侠和盖世五侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We are the Dragon Warrior and the Furious Five,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要来把你绳之于法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are here to bring you to justice"!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？这地方到处都是恶狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? This place is crawling with wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不就是那个家伙锤扁你的脸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, isn't that the guy who hammered you in the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那个家伙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.75,0:30:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得摸进高塔 而且千万不能被恶狼发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to that tower without being spotted by those wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了 神出鬼没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Stealth mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.49,0:31:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 又失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the way! - Foiled again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.80,0:31:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吖 呵呵呵呵 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I couldn't help but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.67,0:31:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了 我在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, OK. Anyway, where was l?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.93,0:31:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波到哪去了？- 我们怎么会搞丢一个胖子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Po? - How can we lose a guy that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.65,0:31:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波… - 哦 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Po. - What? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.61,0:31:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也叫神出鬼没 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that was stealth mode, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.28,0:31:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的啦 这个并不是我的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, not one of my stronger modes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.91,0:31:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有更多的金子呢 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold in there, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这米还是生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This rice is raw!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抢走我所有的厨具呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole all my metal pots for Lord Shen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.84,0:31:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不帮我煮饭，那我就煮了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you cook my rice, or I cook you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.17,0:32:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊对不起… - 阿波 快去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My apologies, but… - Po, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该怎么帮她煮饭又不会被逮到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to help her cook rice without getting caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.76,0:32:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我有高的办法 - 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, I have a better idea. - …two…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.97,0:32:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.35,0:32:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.28,0:32:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来解救百姓 把沈王爷绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to liberate the city and bring Shen to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.87,0:32:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会需要帮忙 - 谢谢你 勇敢的羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will need help. - Thank you, brave sheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是太危险了 不能让你帮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's too dangerous. I can't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.37,0:32:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我不是我啦 这里说话不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not me. It's not safe to speak here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.71,0:32:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.55,0:32:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是铁牛侠跟流星鳄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about Masters Ox and Croc.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.22,0:32:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被关在黑龙巷里的宫门大牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in Gongmen Jail on Black Dragon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.76,0:32:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？他们还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? They're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.55,0:32:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两位大侠一定是去牢里收集情报 筹划怎么用超赞武功打败那个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be in that jail gathering intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.72,0:32:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,筹划怎么用超赞武功打败那个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}hatching a plot to use their awesomeness to defeat the weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.60,0:32:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 羊MM - 嘿！快点拦下那玩样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, sheep. - Hey! Stop that costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.69,0:32:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要动 - 抓住他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it right there! - Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.65,0:32:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住他们！ - 呃…抱歉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them! - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.24,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看招！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.91,0:33:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走！- 快一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep going! - Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.53,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.77,0:33:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 小心！ - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! Watch it! - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.94,0:33:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,包围他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surround him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.11,0:33:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？他们跑哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 分头搜！给我到处搜！- 这里要不要搜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spread out! Search everywhere! - What about over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难道「那里」不算到处吗 - 哦…算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is "there" a part of "everywhere"? - I…I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.41,0:33:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不快搜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then search there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.88,0:33:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定很近 因为我的后背忽然感到一阵冰冰凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be close. I can feel a kung fu chill riding up my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.46,0:33:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿波 是我啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Po. It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.63,0:33:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看！宫门大牢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Gongmen Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.27,0:34:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…好Q哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.14,0:34:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好Q？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.83,0:34:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有个风吹草动 我就会这样 嘎嘎…叽叽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the first sign of trouble, I'll give you a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.00,0:34:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像灵鹤那样哦？- 对 不好意思！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean like Crane does? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.96,0:34:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我的声音哪有那么难听啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, when have I ever made that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.17,0:34:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁牛侠！大侠…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Ox! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.76,0:34:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星鳄大侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ferocious Master Croc!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…跟风暴铁牛侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Master Storming Ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.56,0:34:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 我们在营救功夫界的传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we're rescuing actual legends of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你们救出去的 没问题的 这附近肯一定有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna free you from those bonds of injustice. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.69,0:34:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 他们不可能会乱放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be a key around here. No, they wouldn't leave a key around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.73,0:34:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 赞…你找到了！来吧各位 耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good! You found it. Come on, you guys! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.74,0:34:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来找你了 老沈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming for you, Shen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.33,0:35:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 你们来不来啊 你们想待会再来会合吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, are we going or not? Do you want to meet us there later?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.63,0:35:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们也想夺回宫门城 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you do want to take back your city, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.54,0:35:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.42,0:35:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能反抗沈王爷 他一定会炸掉宫门城！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we stand up to Shen, he will turn the weapon on the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听没有懂 你们要保护宫门城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to yourself. You're protecting Gongmen City…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才不保护宫门城哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}by not protecting Gongmen City?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.35,0:35:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要我们手牵手心连心… - 他就会用武器杀死所有居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If we all fight together… - Then the weapon would kill everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.14,0:35:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是哦？那我们用…偷袭的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, would it? Then we use…a sneak attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.06,0:35:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 偷偷进去 然后… - 然后你们就会被挡住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We get inside and then… - And then you will be stopped…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被挡不住的武器挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the unstoppable weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.57,0:35:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上没有什么是我挡不住的 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's unstoppable except for me when I'm stopping you…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.08,0:35:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我有什么是挡不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from telling me something's unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.05,0:35:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁牛侠 我不能让你继续待在牢里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Ox, I'm not letting you stay in this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.97,0:35:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你怎么让我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see you get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到没？这一招真的超赞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys see that? It's called being awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.98,0:35:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们不当英雄哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Whatever happened to being heroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.02,0:36:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宫门城当英雄只有死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only hero in this town is a dead one!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.37,0:36:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 你休想把我给弄出这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, you are not getting me out of this cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.83,0:36:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 赞了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.71,0:36:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要睡上铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the top bunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.97,0:36:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就认输吧 熊猫 功夫死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to surrender, panda. Kung fu is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.30,0:36:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.93,0:36:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.18,0:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,功夫死了。。好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kung fu is dead? Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就抱着恐惧待在失望的大牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay in your prison of fear with bars made of hopelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.15,0:36:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,三餐拿丢人献眼配饭吃好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all you get are three square meaIs a day of shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拿绝望当甜点\N{\fnArial\fs30}With despair for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.32,0:36:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去对付老沈 证明给内心渴望正义和荣誉的老百姓看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take on Shen and prove to all those who are hungry…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「因为功夫永远不会死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}for justice and honour that kung fu still lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.75,0:36:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.25,0:36:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘎嘎！你…是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.42,0:37:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 什么是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what's gonna be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.55,0:37:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的铁拳会打烂你那软趴趴的嘴脸 啊哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fist in your plush, cuddly, super-soft face!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.10,0:37:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.06,0:37:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快带我出去！- 好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me out of here! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.98,0:37:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波走 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甩掉他！- 遵命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lose him! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 俏小龙 - 抓好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Viper! - Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.97,0:37:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 小心咯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.31,0:37:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不酷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncool! Very uncool!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.77,0:37:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些 送你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.73,0:37:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.15,0:37:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,再小一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.28,0:38:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好快点从我脸上爬下来！不好意思！不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute bunnies, off the face. Excuse me! OK, pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.35,0:38:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,火哦！着火了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.72,0:38:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,追丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.28,0:38:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！再来一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again! Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.36,0:38:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵鹤 接住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crane, catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.08,0:38:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位…推我一把！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, guys, guys, give me a shove!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.17,0:38:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快螳螂 上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mantis, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.57,0:39:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么点料我感觉像在跟一坨软棉棉的云打架！？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you got? It feeIs like I'm fighting a big old fluffy cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.57,0:39:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这头也准备要打雷了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this cloud is about to bring the thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.04,0:39:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.29,0:39:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有…这么…多…招牌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why…are…there…so…many…signs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.64,0:39:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来！我就喜欢压死你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here! Alaka-squasho!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.27,0:39:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！吃败仗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Taste the defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.82,0:39:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.36,0:39:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次想要惹熊猫最好多料几个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you mess with a panda, you better bring a whole a…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.17,0:40:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你八成没听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess nobody told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹毛一匹狼下场会很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you mess with the wolf, you get the fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.55,0:40:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第二拳…你现在想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hit you twice. What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.35,0:40:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投降！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.81,0:40:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以铐住我的身体 确永远铐不住我的…一身傲骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can chain my body, but you will never chain my…warrior spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.19,0:40:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 别忘了这个小家伙！- 你又叫我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, don't forget the little guy. - Did you just call…?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.86,0:40:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 你在干嘛？- 相信我 我有计划…哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po, what are you doing? - Trust me. I got a pl…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.58,0:40:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊不会吧！居然用奇门八穴手拷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. Eight-point acupressure cuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.75,0:40:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年铐住残豹也是用这一种 超动铐的越紧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the ones that held Tai Lung. The more you move, the tighter they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.75,0:40:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最赞的手铐 哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the best cuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.42,0:40:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 熊猫 见到你了 终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, panda. At last we meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.47,0:40:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.60,0:40:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是终于见到你啦！对！没错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We meet at last! Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 熊猫 终于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, panda. We meet at…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会害怕也是正常的 - 我不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are afraid for a reason. - I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.70,0:41:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他铐着手铐来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is coming to me in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.62,0:41:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要说有谁该怕？也是… - 你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If anyone should be afraid, it's… - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.37,0:41:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连想都不要想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.97,0:41:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拜托你有点长进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this turns out better than your plan to cook rice in your stomach…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.89,0:41:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次吞生米喝热水煮饭的那一招实在很逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}by eating it raw and then drinking boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.40,0:41:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划跟那个计划不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This plan's nothing like that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 这个计划会成功的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - 'Cause this one's going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…我的死对头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my old enemy…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.10,0:42:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是楼梯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你背我上最后那几个楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for carrying me those last few flights. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.89,0:42:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了，我刚才在三楼吐了几口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw up a little bit on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.47,0:42:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好找人去抹一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone might want to clean that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.06,0:42:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有没有邪恶的打扫阿姨啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there some sort of evil janitor or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.89,0:42:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.65,0:42:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 终于见… - 嘿 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We meet at… - Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.69,0:42:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.28,0:42:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长的比我想的还要大只\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown up bigger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.45,0:42:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我有点 够了哦 不要毛手毛脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…enough with the poking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.33,0:43:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,既强壮 又健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong. Healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.25,0:43:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 我又不认识你 让开一点大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know who you are, but please stand aside, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是女的！- 哦…不好意思啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a lady. - Oh! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.71,0:43:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡子很唬人啦 我都骗到了 干嘛骗人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beard threw me. It's kind of misleading.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.59,0:43:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 虚假广告 - 不要在那鬼扯蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- False advertising. - Enough of this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.84,0:43:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把犯人押上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the prisoners to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.68,0:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思啊 大婶 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, ma'am. Get ready, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.47,0:43:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人的眼睛全都盯着…武器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes peeled for the…weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.44,0:43:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,马字飞踢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparrow kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.69,0:43:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！我用用功夫K掉它，你们看到没有 我就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it! I just kung fu-ed it! Did you guys see that? I was all like…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.04,0:43:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 你真的相信他是那个会打败我的家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you actually believe this is the warrior destined to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.46,0:43:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止相信 我知道！他就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not. I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他！想报仇想了一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at him. A lifetime to plot his revenge…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.55,0:43:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结果却跪在我面前 - 什么？你说一辈子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and he comes to me on his knees. - What? A lifetime?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.22,0:43:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！我并没有花一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not have a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.64,0:43:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是几天前才听说雷霆犀利侠的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only heard about Master Rhino a few days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.77,0:44:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以才来替他报仇！- 难道你就没有别的仇要报了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we came to avenge him! - You've come to avenge nothing else?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.65,0:44:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦有哇 你抢走了大家的锅碗瓢盆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. All the pots and pans that you stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.32,0:44:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要全都拿回来 - 还有没有其它的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna want those back. - Nothing else?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.90,0:44:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们还做了一堆有的没的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably did some other evil stuff along the way. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.66,0:44:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你还做了什么哦？- 你不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What else did you do? - You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.95,0:44:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么？你在笑什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what? What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.37,0:44:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在笑你原来你还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very thing that you clearly do not know!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.67,0:44:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 不要再打哑迷！一次把话说清楚好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, enough of these riddles! Would you guys spill the beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.75,0:44:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进来一看呢 这个武器好很小 骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we come in and the weapon is tiny. Surprise, it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.26,0:44:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它超大。然后这边这个大婶。我以为他是大叔。他有胡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the lady over here, I think it's a guy, 'cause he's got…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.60,0:44:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到现在还能够活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you are still alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.31,0:44:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我觉得你这个蠢才 挺有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I find your stupidity mildly amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.27,0:44:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 可是我觉得你 邪恶的超级固人怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you. But I find your evilness extremely annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.77,0:44:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊 熊猫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you are, panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.82,0:44:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是谁啊 孔雀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think I am, peacock?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.12,0:44:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在笑什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.33,0:44:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.18,0:45:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.73,0:45:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 快 快把它点燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, light the…thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.61,0:45:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我点了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.99,0:45:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫虫入侵了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear the bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.92,0:45:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快抢武器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.38,0:45:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.09,0:46:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…You were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.67,0:46:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你竟然让沈王爷跑了 - 至少 我们毁了武器啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just let Shen get away! - At least we destroyed the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.28,0:46:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.66,0:46:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…错！他还有很多存货 喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No, he's got way more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.83,0:46:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的翅膀！- 阿波 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My wing! - Help, Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.38,0:46:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.67,0:46:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波！- 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.38,0:47:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉我上去！- 不用 放他下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me up! - No. Get him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.43,0:47:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那条绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑哇 跑哇 小熊猫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, run, little panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.21,0:47:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 拜托！你必须专心一点 - 我行 我可以！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po, come on. We need you to focus! - I got it, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.46,0:47:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.55,0:47:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被困住了！- 走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're trapped! - This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.77,0:47:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放箭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.56,0:47:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.03,0:47:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有往上爬才出得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way out is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.74,0:48:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.18,0:48:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来！来呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去哪里呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.72,0:48:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上塔顶！- 快点 快点爬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the top! - Come on! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.82,0:48:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.05,0:48:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这蠢材！- 我的鼻子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You idiot! - My nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.55,0:48:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集恶狼军…总体出动！我要他们立刻做好准备！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call in the wolves! All of them! I want them ready to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,孔雀年 就从现在开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Year of the Peacock begins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.94,0:49:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？可是一年都过了一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now? 'Cause it's the middle of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.98,0:49:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么算你的孔雀年只剩下半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'd only get like a haIf of the Year of the Peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.44,0:49:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 就当今年是孔雀年好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the Year, of course, of the Peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.74,0:49:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy New Year, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.58,0:49:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫恶狼军备战 我们马上有登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the wolves ready. We're loading the ships now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.00,0:49:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.25,0:49:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 快 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, now, now, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.34,0:49:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.53,0:49:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.53,0:49:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.71,0:49:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.96,0:49:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么啊？上面一团乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do? It's chaos up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.21,0:49:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要阻止沈王爷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to stopping Shen?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.34,0:50:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.38,0:50:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛 要对我有信心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on. Give me a little credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.72,0:50:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是故意放走他的啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant for him to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.02,0:50:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…这是陷阱 是圈套！\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause…it was a trick. It was a plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.14,0:50:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想 嗯 搞清楚他有什么阴谋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking…I'll figure out his plot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.73,0:50:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听没有懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.90,0:50:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？这也不懂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.74,0:50:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波 说实话！你逮到他了 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, the truth. You had Shen. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.24,0:50:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啦？什么啦 我听不懂你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.45,0:50:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！呃…好啦，我没注意到他嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…Yeah…OK, he caught me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.71,0:50:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.34,0:50:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！他们会让你远离危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. They will keep you far from danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.26,0:50:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常远 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Real far. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.97,0:50:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.60,0:50:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…等一下！我得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I have to go ba…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.40,0:50:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.77,0:50:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我要去 你不能阻止我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going. And you can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.24,0:51:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 刚才我还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I wasn't ready that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.66,0:51:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.54,0:51:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.25,0:51:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.84,0:51:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.85,0:51:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一定要去找他 - 给我一个理由！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to get to him. - Then tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.31,0:51:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他也在，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there! OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.81,0:51:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后一次看到爹娘的时候 孔雀也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The peacock was there the last time I saw my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.19,0:51:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道发生了什么事 我从什么地方来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what happened. Where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.99,0:51:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.00,0:51:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.75,0:51:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.34,0:51:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种强者是不会了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard core can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.55,0:51:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎！不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.43,0:51:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是强者也能了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard core do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.14,0:52:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能让朋友去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't watch my friend be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.19,0:52:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧！- 嘿 让我去送死就没差哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're going. - Maybe you can't watch me be killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.44,0:52:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么胆小 - 她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop being a wimp. - And she's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.03,0:52:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 别想太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Don't worry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.37,0:52:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这里比较\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're better off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.71,0:52:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 羊仙姑 我们今晚将航向胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong, Soothsayer. We sail to victory tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.05,0:52:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个神奇熊猫根本是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your magic panda is clearly a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.55,0:52:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的确定笨的是那只熊猫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain it is the panda who is a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.68,0:52:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚才把自己的王宫给毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just destroyed your ancestral home, Shen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本不算什么 因为全中国都将属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trivial sacrifice…when all of China is my reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.73,0:52:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就心满意足了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then will you finally be satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.36,0:52:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界向你俯首称臣 你的心情就会好起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the subjugation of the whole world finally make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.12,0:52:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 刚开始嘛 也许我会把地下室改建成地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a start. I might also convert the basement into a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.04,0:53:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的欲望永远得不到满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cup you choose to fill has no bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.92,0:53:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上这种疯狂的行为吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to stop this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.97,0:53:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要停止啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why on earth would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.05,0:53:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你的双亲安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your parents can rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.10,0:53:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的双亲痛恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.27,0:53:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明不明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.31,0:53:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对不起我…我。。我要改变这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wronged me…and I will make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.86,0:53:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.32,0:53:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为太爱你 在把你送走之后才会抑郁而终\N{\fnArial\fs30}They loved you so much that having to send you away killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.66,0:53:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事就不要再提了 我要创造我自己的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead exist in the past…and I must tend to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.30,0:53:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把羊仙姑放了吧 她没有用处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set the soothsayer free. She's no use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.51,0:53:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了 希望你得到幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Shen. I wish you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.31,0:53:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福要靠自己夺取！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happiness must be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.65,0:54:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我势在必得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动作快点！- 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry it up! - Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.80,0:54:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这些武器全送出去 中国会沦陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}If all of those weapons leave the building, China will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.10,0:54:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们就把这里弄跨 - 嘿 大伙 这样行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We bring down the building. - Hey, guys. How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.02,0:54:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢！一定行！- 那好 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This will work! - All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.36,0:54:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脸麻掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't feel my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.33,0:54:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛…哪有孔雀年这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear him call it Year of the Peacock?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.46,0:55:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕 不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So, keep it cool. Keep it cool. Keep it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.59,0:55:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.10,0:55:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来！正经一点 不要在那里傻笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet! And wipe those stupid grins off your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.99,0:55:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 废物 快！快点！搬上船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, you dogs! Faster, faster! Load them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.09,0:55:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 你好啊 熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.68,0:55:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快说那晚是怎么回事 - 哪一晚啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me what happened that night. - What night?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.85,0:55:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那一晚！- 哦 那一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That night. - Ah, that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.02,0:55:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！我们说的是同一个晚对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! We're talking about the same night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.94,0:55:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是在那里 没错 我看见你的爹娘抛弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was there. Yes. I watched as your parents abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:56:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是惨绝人寰 当时的情况就像这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a terrible thing. I believe it went something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.63,0:56:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,贺岁大礼来啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your New Year's gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.26,0:56:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是喜欢，因为不能退货 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you like it, 'cause you can't return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.30,0:56:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波？他在这里干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po? What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.60,0:56:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,退货！退货！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return it! Return it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.90,0:56:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的死也要知道真相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to die to find the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.62,0:56:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说啊！如果可以不要死最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet I am. Although I'd prefer not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.98,0:57:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我们！走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.93,0:57:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我说的太早了对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that too soon, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.15,0:57:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.07,0:57:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 离他远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, get away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.78,0:57:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上的去，没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get up. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.54,0:58:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要再逃了 老沈！- 说的也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No more running, Shen. - So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.38,0:58:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.55,0:58:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的这么想知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you want to know so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.92,0:58:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了就能解脱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think knowing will heal you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.30,0:58:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,以弥补心灵的缺憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill some crater in your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.52,0:58:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你就告诉你真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.85,0:58:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爹娘根本就不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents didn't love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.98,0:58:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.03,0:58:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你解脱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me heal you!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.70,0:58:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.08,0:59:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 不要想逼我喝下 啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like you could make me drink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.84,0:59:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如果要害你 就会留你在河里自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted you dead, I would have left you in that river.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.26,1:00:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛救我？- 为了要让你完成你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, why save me? - So you can fulfil your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.39,1:00:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么东东？这是哪里啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.89,1:00:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.60,1:00:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到你居然不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised you remember so little.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.78,1:00:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那时你年纪还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were so little when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.53,1:00:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you do remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.25,1:00:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个讨厌的恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's just a stupid nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.42,1:00:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是噩梦？还是记忆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmare? Or memory?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前很热闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a thriving village.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.25,1:01:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,沈王爷是宫门城的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Shen was in line to rule Gongmen City.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.96,1:01:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他野心太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wanted more.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.96,1:01:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预言未来有人会出手阻止他 一只熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I foretold that someone would stand in his way. A panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.89,1:01:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是确万万没有想到会发生那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never could have foretold what came next.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.03,1:01:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,全杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.21,1:01:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走儿子快点逃走！走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take our son and run away! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.06,1:02:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要抗拒 敞开心胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop fighting. Let it flow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.62,1:04:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的故事也许没有快乐的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your story may not have such a happy beginning,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.87,1:04:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不能决定你是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that doesn't make you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.17,1:04:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你接下来所做的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the rest of your story.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.55,1:04:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要成为什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you choose to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.88,1:04:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 熊猫你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you, panda?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.51,1:05:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿波\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.73,1:05:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一顶帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna need a hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.11,1:05:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好难过好伤心的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such sad, sad faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.66,1:05:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是欢乐的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now is a time only for joy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.12,1:05:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将要看到的场表很壮观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to be part of something beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们一到港口 一起面对全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we reach the harbour, in front of all the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.59,1:05:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们和珍贵的功夫会一起死 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your precious kung fu will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.93,1:05:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时中国将会臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then China will know to bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.02,1:05:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.95,1:05:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.85,1:06:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说我没想过会这么早死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, guys, I never thought I'd die like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.19,1:06:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为会遇到个MM订下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought I'd meet a nice girl and settle down and…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.36,1:06:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让她吃掉我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she'd eat my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.28,1:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好衰啊 - 不能放弃希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So sad. - We cannot give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.86,1:06:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波也不希望我们放弃，我们是强者！对吧 悍娇虎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po would want us to remain strong. Hard-core. Right, Tigress?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.38,1:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 王爷 那座桥怎么办？- 什么都挡不住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Shen, what about the bridge? - Nothing stands in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.05,1:06:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.52,1:07:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个胆小鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coward!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.78,1:07:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.91,1:07:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底要杀几次才杀得死这只臭熊猫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to kill the same stinking panda?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.64,1:07:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老沈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.22,1:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只熊猫会阻止你和你的野心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A panda stands between you and your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.98,1:07:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.19,1:07:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,束手就擒，我要将你绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare yourseIf for a hot serving of justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.36,1:07:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恐怖统治要完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reign of terror comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.19,1:07:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 现在…拯救五侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - And now, free the Five!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.62,1:07:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,血滴子来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disc of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.80,1:08:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够了 瞄准！\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.02,1:08:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.59,1:08:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.72,1:08:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快轰他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.10,1:08:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们开始吧 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Here we go. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.11,1:08:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 别 别开炮！- 别开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, don't shoot! - Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.65,1:08:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.86,1:09:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开炮！- 别开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't shoot! - Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.45,1:09:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开炮！- 你不开炮我就不开炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't shoot! - I won't shoot if you won't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.24,1:09:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.45,1:09:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会打到我！别开炮！- 进攻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't shoot! Cross fire! - Attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.51,1:09:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了自由 - 猴王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Catch of Freedom! - Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.31,1:09:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺不错的 神龙大侠 你的计划呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive, Dragon Warrior. What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.68,1:09:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一步 拯救五侠 - 那第二步呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step one, free the Five. - What's step two?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.02,1:09:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我也没想到第一步会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I didn't think I'd make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.94,1:09:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.15,1:09:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找沈王爷不让他去港口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Shen before he gets to the harbour.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.82,1:09:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.45,1:09:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,俏小龙 死亡傀儡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viper, Puppet of Death!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.50,1:09:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.22,1:09:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铁牛侠！- 我跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master Ox! - Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.38,1:09:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 流星鳄！- 我们报仇血恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Croc! - Vengeance is served.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.05,1:10:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么…？- 你的朋友很有说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did you…? - Your friend there is very persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.52,1:10:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,师傅来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.07,1:10:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点用他们的船挡住去路！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly. Use their boats to block the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.21,1:10:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵鹤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crane!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.21,1:10:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,展翅膀正义扬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wings of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.22,1:10:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵呵 耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.56,1:10:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.61,1:10:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…爱…你…们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.63,1:11:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还不开炮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we firing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.46,1:11:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把炮手打倒了！他们逼近了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taking out our gunners, sir. They're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.68,1:11:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！快开炮 开炮打他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Fire at them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.30,1:11:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 王爷！那炸死我军… - 我叫你开炮就开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But, sir, we'll kill our own. - I said fire at them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.06,1:11:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.73,1:11:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.41,1:11:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.28,1:12:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍娇虎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.25,1:13:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你满意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.13,1:13:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个了断吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.45,1:13:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.71,1:13:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气 平心静气 平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.99,1:14:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再轰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.33,1:14:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.67,1:14:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他！来个人杀了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him! Somebody kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.82,1:14:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开炮！快开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep firing! Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.53,1:15:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,接招吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skadoosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.27,1:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你是怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you…?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.02,1:15:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.49,1:15:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是抬起手肘 肩膀要放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you just keep your elbows up and keep the shoulders loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.28,1:15:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你怎么能平心静气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that. How did you find peace?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.62,1:16:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我夺走你的爹娘 你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took away your parents. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.46,1:16:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你伤痕累累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scarred you for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.46,1:16:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 可是你要知道 伤疤会好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's the thing, Shen. Scars heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.13,1:16:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你错了 是伤口会好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't. Wounds heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.30,1:16:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 那伤疤呢？会不见了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. What do scars do? They fade, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.89,1:16:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不在乎伤疤会怎样 - 你必须要在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care what scars do. - You should, Shen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.48,1:16:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须忘记过去所有的伤痛 因为那些并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let go of that stuff from the past, 'cause it just doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.56,1:16:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真正重要的是 你想当一个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that matters is what you choose to be now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.24,1:16:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.82,1:16:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想…这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I choose…this!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.01,1:17:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还挺强的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pretty hard-core.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.56,1:17:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 - 你做到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po! - You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.81,1:17:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来！- 以后别再这样了 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here! Yeah! - Don't ever do that again, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.07,1:17:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你领悟了平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you have found inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.91,1:17:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可说是少年有成\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at such a young age.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.41,1:17:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的师父很高杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I had a pretty good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.27,1:18:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫他不在？今天是我儿子的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean he's not here? It's my son's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.10,1:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一心一意想见到神龙大侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he wanted was to meet the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.65,1:18:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮你儿子做个豆腐生日蛋糕怎么样啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about some tofu birthday cake instead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.57,1:18:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我们改天有空再来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think we'll just try again another time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.57,1:18:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候会回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do you think he'll be back?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.91,1:18:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 拜托？我不知道！也许他不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. OK, I don't know. Maybe never.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.08,1:18:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很担心好吗？天下父母心 我是他爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I worry, OK? But that's my job, I'm his dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.59,1:18:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码我也养过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, I was his dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.96,1:18:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要去救中国 我知道原因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he have to go and save China? I know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.76,1:18:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必呢？他只不过是一只小熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why? He's just one little panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.99,1:19:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 结果怎么样？你救了中国没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did it go? Did you save China?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.79,1:19:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.33,1:19:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I knew you would.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.79,1:19:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请人做了新招牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I had new signs made.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.71,1:19:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子救国 你救荷包\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My son saved China. You, too, can save.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.13,1:19:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来买包子 买一送一！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy one dumpling, get one free."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.80,1:19:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爹你真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's a pretty good deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.34,1:19:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要吃一个？- 等一下再吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like to try one? - Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.81,1:19:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I should tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.69,1:19:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开之后，找到了我出生的村子\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I was gone, I found the village where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.82,1:19:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道我为什么会放在那个萝卜篮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out how I ended up in that radish basket.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.36,1:19:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.83,1:19:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道我是谁 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know who I am. - You do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.75,1:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.51,1:19:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.18,1:19:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.10,1:20:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 有美味可口的大萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious, fat radishes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.31,1:20:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你八成饿坏了 我来煮点东西给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably hungry. Let me make you something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.61,1:20:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托不要闹了啦 我来煮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? I'll cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.52,1:20:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 我煮 - 爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, I'll cook. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.11,1:20:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应该做的 你救了中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the least I can do. You saved China.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.40,1:20:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这才是我该做的 你把我养大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's the least I can do. You raised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.86,1:20:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 - 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po. - Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.07,1:20:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿波 - 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po! - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.70,1:20:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我们两个人。。一起煮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's both cook. Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.50,1:20:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.96,1:20:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃不 我煮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.46,1:20:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子还活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is alive.
